1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,000
Failed payments aren't all the same.

2
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:09,000
Blind retries can make things worse.

3
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:12,000
RevenueGuard AI

4
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:20,000
Understand failures. Recover safely. Prove the lift.

5
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:28,000
Turn failed payments into informed decisions.

6
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:43,000
Start with 50 failed payments.

7
00:00:43,000 --> 00:00:52,000
Not every failure should be retried.

8
00:00:52,000 --> 00:01:04,000
Now make the failure systemic.

9
00:01:04,000 --> 00:01:15,000
A degraded payment rail. An OPEN circuit.

10
00:01:15,000 --> 00:01:25,000
Suppress harmful retries. Wait for recovery.

11
00:01:25,000 --> 00:01:30,000
First: is recovery worth attempting?

12
00:01:30,000 --> 00:01:39,000
A probability—not a promise.

13
00:01:39,000 --> 00:01:50,000
Every score comes with reason codes.

14
00:01:50,000 --> 00:02:02,000
Diagnose. Check the rail. Choose the strategy.

15
00:02:02,000 --> 00:02:19,000
The AI can reason.

16
00:02:19,000 --> 00:02:31,000
But it cannot bypass policy.

17
00:02:31,000 --> 00:02:43,000
₹75,000 at stake. Human approval required.

18
00:02:43,000 --> 00:02:54,000
AI proposes. Policy decides. Humans retain control.

19
00:02:54,000 --> 00:03:04,000
Approved—and still subject to the circuit breaker.

20
00:03:04,000 --> 00:03:19,000
Connected to Razorpay. Strictly TEST mode.

21
00:03:19,000 --> 00:03:30,000
Verify the signature. Reject the duplicate.

22
00:03:30,000 --> 00:03:36,000
Now ask the question that matters.

23
00:03:36,000 --> 00:03:47,000
Does it beat the baseline?

24
00:03:47,000 --> 00:03:59,000
+9.9 percentage-point recovery lift

25
00:03:59,000 --> 00:04:04,000
RevenueGuard AI
